  "owner_instruction_excerpt": "Fix my regression from af0bd80 (hermes-agent 0.21.0 -> 0.21.4): Hermes 0.21.4 hermes doctor exits 1 whenever a listed issue remains, so DIAL counted the intended missing-API-keys issue as FAIL and qualification stopped. The DIAL native-doctor summarizer treats a run with no failure lines and only listed issues as DEGRADED regardless of exit code; a failure line or a non-zero exit with no listed issues stays FAIL.",
